            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.1.26

- Launch now handles changed desktop dependencies while the renderer is running: Weft pauses this checkout's managed processes, prepares dependencies, restores its services, then opens the app.
- Bringing an already-running desktop app forward does not reinstall dependencies or restart it.
- Dependency preparation records the completed lockfile state, preventing unnecessary preparation on the next launch.
]]></description>
